{"unit_id":"fromluli__dsh-advisor-mode#card-zh","repo":"fromluli/dsh-advisor-mode","commit":"f215d21d3b1a9d57ed83e60dfbd9074867b0e841","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-advisor-mode 是面向 DSH desktop 和 web 的顾问模式插件。它通过 /advisor 命令控制会话开关，并注册 consult_advisor 工具，让主模型把会话记录和待审问题交给顾问模型，获得 proceed、revise 或 stop 建议。适合需要第二意见审查方案、排查重复错误或检查较大任务的开发者。可固定顾问 provider/model，也可复用会话路由；需配置顾问模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:586-745","cordis.patch.yml:14-22"]}
{"unit_id":"fromluli__dsh-advisor-mode#card-en","repo":"fromluli/dsh-advisor-mode","commit":"f215d21d3b1a9d57ed83e60dfbd9074867b0e841","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-advisor-mode adds a session advisor to DSH. Use /advisor to toggle it; consult_advisor sends the session and a question to an advisor model for a proceed, revise, or stop recommendation. Configure a provider and model, or reuse the session route.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:586-745","cordis.patch.yml:14-22"]}
